Error [jet.BitLogicMixup]: `~=` updates by exclusive-or; a condition compares with `!=`
  --> Tests/UI/bit_xor_update_in_condition.jet:4:14
    |
  4 |     if count ~= 4 {
    |              ^^
 Why: `~=` assigns `a ~ b` back to `a`, and a header needs a Bool
 Fix: Write `!=` to test that the values differ
